    "definition": "A current complete-for-declared-coverage Vietnam five-digit assignment and exact permitted Polygon/MultiPolygon artifact pin code-to-area semantics, jurisdiction, validity, CRS, schema, topology, terms, edition and SHA-256. An approved immutable artifact is loaded by the VN runtime/API and verified in the app through normalized search, loading/not-found/multiple/API-failure/invalid/non-area states, fit, translucent fill, clear outline, clear/re-search and visible official/derived/virtual authority, source, basis date and confidence. Administrative-unit assignments or borders, office and Vpostcode points, buffers, Voronoi cells and models never become official postal areas; point, route, P.O. box, organization and unknown codes are not forced into polygons; house numbers and buildings require separate explicit permitted stable relations. Synthetic fixtures, shared UI code or a text-only portal never establish M2."
